  (text "BASE — ESP32-S3 dev-board socket, I2C, expansion header, star point" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cefd1e96-d8e8-5cc3-9e14-21d43ef02b34"))
  (text "Dev board: Jinhua #40729, ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 pin order (Espressif user guide). 3V3 pins NOT connected (dev board LDO must not fight the carrier's AMS1117)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8935b807-acb8-5855-a26d-a6c99817646c"))
  (text "Strapping pins IO0/IO45/IO46 left open; IO3 is unused as well (v0.7: it was DIO8 — the strapping question is closed by not using it). IO35-37 (octal PSRAM) and IO48 (on-board WS2812) unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da690945-d3b2-5ccb-8803-4ec8e9a0edfb"))
  (text "GPIO map v0.7 (re-spec 8.2, interface contract): IO41 DDS_FSYNC, IO42 DDS_PSEL, IO40 TX_EN, IO8 RX_BLANK, IO9/IO14 HB_IN1/HB_IN2, IO47 FET_GATE. DIO1-8 and RELAY1-4 moved to the TCA9535 I2C expander (B5), which frees IO4/6/7/15 to the expansion header." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "daf36117-01e8-584d-b7c8-a6d42203d6d8"))
  (text "I2C addresses: TCA9535 GPIO expander 0x20 (A0 = A1 = A2 = GND, B5), Si5351A clock generator 0x60, OLED 0x3C. 400 kHz, 4.7 k pull-ups here; Qwiic J4 inside the box and a second Qwiic on the front panel (through the link)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3de60383-68b2-521a-ab2f-b64964f29434"))
  (text "Socket row spacing 25.4 mm ASSUMED from the 28 mm-wide clone (HANDOVER 2026-09-05) — MEASURE a #40729 before ordering (docs/design-decisions.md D-12)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "761c1454-33c9-5468-af40-d53717413f2a"))
  (text "SPI2 on IO_MUX pins: 33 R series at the source on SCLK/MOSI (here) and on SDO at the ADC (B1). All inter-sheet signals are global labels; rails are power symbols." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "01c8448b-1e67-53f8-b227-4d03fbd94243"))
  (text "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 / Jinhua #40729 (plugged in, USB-C ports face the rear/power edge)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 92 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9a4bf1d6-3fd9-544b-b61c-ddd704d4d20b"))
  (text "antenna u.FL -> pigtail -> rear SMA bulkhead" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 95.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99ba5dac-d2f1-59b9-97ed-6a2619d29eb7"))
  (text "IO0, IO45, IO46 = strapping (open); IO3 unused (v0.7)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200 156 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c71aa866-e21a-56c6-867a-28c46485a23b"))
  (text "IO35-37 = octal PSRAM, IO48 = on-board RGB LED" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200 159 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5071dc11-cbb0-5a5a-9560-8e475a5a4913"))
  (text "GPIO map v0.7 (re-spec 8.2) — interface contract" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee4c7e31-373a-56b7-a383-0e38e7ca6342"))
  (text "33 R source termination for the 80 MHz-capable SPI2 lines (practices 14)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 195 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1e4c5bb9-e84c-539e-b523-3fad068b0f8f"))
  (text "I2C 400 kHz pull-ups (OLED 0x3C + Qwiic J4 inside + the panel Qwiic)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 240 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da2ad232-e0b6-5e8c-9cb1-149d8b677ef0"))
  (text "Expansion header J5 (2x10), pinout D-17 v0.7: the four GPIO freed by the expander (4/6/7/15) took pins 16/17/19/20" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 287 138 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fb6c3032-4d7e-5002-b825-ee35aa47ec79"))
  (text "Panel LED drive: bridged by default; open JP1 when the OPT chain uses GPIO43 as CS, JP2 when the TCXO option feeds GPIO44" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215 195 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5ec498cb-726b-54f3-9d68-6dd815b38121"))
  (text "The ONLY AGND-GND join (net tie NT1, copper only). Placed at the B1/BASE boundary." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aaa73e51-ce2b-5d7b-a631-4d383c733042"))
